cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to or build on this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Potential-free Customizable Contraction Hierarchies for Negative Edge Weights"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gupta
    given-names: Aarav
repository-code: "https://github.com/AaravG/negative-weight-cch"
url: "https://github.com/AaravG/negative-weight-cch"
abstract: >-
  Exact shortest paths on road networks with negative edge weights (e.g.
  electric-vehicle energy with regenerative braking) using Customizable
  Contraction Hierarchies without potentials or Bellman-Ford, including
  exact negative-cycle detection, partial re-customization, and a
  battery-constrained variant.
keywords:
  - shortest paths
  - contraction hierarchies
  - negative edge weights
  - route planning
  - electric vehicles
date-released: "2026-09-18"
version: "0.1.0"
